n analysis from the German Trauma Registry on 8724 patients</article-title><source>Injury</source><year>2007</year><volume>38</volume><fpage>298</fpage><lpage>304</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17214989</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.injury.2006.10.003</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brohi</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Singh</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Heron</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Coats</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Acute traumatic coagulopathy</article-title><source>J Trauma</source><year>2003</year><volume>54</volume><fpage>1127</fpage><lpage>1130</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12813333</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/01.TA.0000069184.82147.06</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schreiber</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Perkins</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Kiraly</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Underwood</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Wade</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Holcomb</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Early predictors of massive transfusion in combat casualties</article-title><source>J Am Coll Surg</source><year>2007</year><volume>205</volume><fpage>541</fpage><lpage>545</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17903727</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.jamcollsurg.2007.05.007</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rotondo</surname><given-names>MF</given-names></name><name><surname>Schwab</surname><given-names>CW</given-names></name><n